NAME
    gcloud beta backup-dr data-source-references - command group for Backup and
        DR Data Source References

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud beta backup-dr data-source-references COMMAND [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    (BETA) Command group for Backup and DR Data Source References.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     describe
        (BETA) Show details of the data source reference.

     fetch-for-resource-type
        (BETA) Fetch Data Source References for a given resource type and
        location.

     list
        (BETA) List Backup and DR data source references.

NOTES
    This command is currently in beta and might change without notice. These
    variants are also available:

        $ gcloud backup-dr data-source-references

        $ gcloud alpha backup-dr data-source-references

